===Etymology 1===
{{inh+|hi|pra-sau|𑀆𑀮𑀼𑀕}}, from {{inh|hi|sa|आलुक||elephant foot yam}}. {{doublet|hi|आलु|आलुक}}. The word began to be used in the sense "potato" after the importation of potatoes to South Asia from the Americas by Europeans, displacing cultivation of the similar [[elephant foot yam]].

